The worker-default tests below have to stage configuration values, and
where they stage them follows from where [[get_worker_default]] reads.
Now that it reads through [[default]], the values must sit in the
[[defaults]] cache rather than in [[config.get]]; patching the latter
would leave the test asserting against whatever the real configuration
file happens to hold.  Because the cache lives for the process, a test
that fills it must also empty it afterwards, or it leaks staged values
into every later test in the run.

Both obligations belong together, so we express them as one context
manager and let the tests read as a table of configuration values.

