Sub-items show their status as a short word rather than the stored
value, so that the eye-catching one---[[active]]---is the item being
worked on.
The rich renderer additionally colours the word; both tables are
defined next to each other so a new status is added to both at once.

<<constants>>=
VIEW_STATUS_MARKS = {
    "done": "done",
    "in-progress": "active",
    "pending": "pending",
}
VIEW_STATUS_STYLES = {
    "done": "green",
    "in-progress": "yellow",
    "pending": "dim",
