The description and the notes are Markdown, so they go through
[[print_markdown]] with the terminal form forced on---forced, because
the decision was already taken by [[--format]] and must not be retaken
from [[isatty()]] inside the helper.
Each block gets a bold title in place of the plain renderer's
[[Label:]] line, and each GitHub comment a header with a bold author
and dimmed date.

<<print description and notes richly>>=
